  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability based on Cultural Heritage, Territory and the Grassroots Organization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundacin Pehun, $76,000 for the first year of a three year agreement. Fundacin Pehun will provide small grants, training and other support to community organizations of poor people to carry out local self-help development projects. Fundacin Pehun will also participate with other members of the Inter- American Network of Corporate Foundations and Actions for Grassroots Development in regional and hemispheric workshops and conferences to share learning, best practices, policies, and methodologies for supporting grassroots development. (CP-001)</narrative>
  </description>
